{"title":"P8716 - P8716 [蓝桥杯 2020 省 AB2] 回文日期 - 洛谷","slug":"2026-05-20-P8716-P8716-蓝桥杯-2020-省-AB2-回文日期-洛谷","date":"2026-05-19T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-20T03:00:04.098Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-20-P8716-P8716-蓝桥杯-2020-省-AB2-回文日期-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"洛谷-P8716-回文日期-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P8716-回文日期-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P8716] 回文日期 - 洛谷\"></a>[洛谷 P8716] 回文日期 - 洛谷</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P8716\">洛谷</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法标签、日期处理标签</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 日期处理、回文判断、循环遍历</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><p>题目要求找到一个日期，这个日期是回文日期，并且满足特定的“ABABBABA”型回文模式。输入是一个四位数年份、月份和日期，输出是满足条件的日期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>问题本质</strong>: 找到一个日期，使其既是回文日期，又符合“ABABBABA”型回文模式。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>: <ul>\n<li>回文日期的判断方法。</li>\n<li>“ABABBABA”型回文模式的定义。</li>\n<li>如何通过循环遍历找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>:<ul>\n<li>判断一个日期是否是回文日期。</li>\n<li>检查日期是否符合“ABABBABA”型回文模式。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用字符串操作来判断回文日期。</li>\n<li>遍历所有可能的日期，直到找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>:<ul>\n<li>选择字符串操作的方法来判断回文日期，因为它简单高效。</li>\n<li>遍历所有日期的方法虽然时间复杂度较高，但可以确保找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>:<ul>\n<li>回文日期的判断通过比较字符串的前后半部分是否相同来实现。</li>\n<li>“ABABBABA”型回文模式的判断通过检查日期的特定位置是否满足模式来实现。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>4.3 数学推导（如适用）</h4><ul>\n<li>无直接数学推导，主要依赖于字符串操作和循环遍历。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串操作 + 循环遍历</td>\n<td>O(n * 365)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预处理 + 直接判断</td>\n<td>O(n * 365)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>大规模数据</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">is_palindrome</span>(<span class=\"params\">s</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> s == s[::-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">is_ababbaba</span>(<span class=\"params\">s</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> s[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">2</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">5</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">7</span>] <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> s[<span class=\"number\">1</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">3</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">4</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">6</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">next_day</span>(<span class=\"params\">y, m, d</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    leap = (y % <span class=\"number\">4</span> == <span class=\"number\">0</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> y % <span class=\"number\">100</span> != <span class=\"number\">0</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">or</span> (y % <span class=\"number\">400</span> == <span class=\"number\">0</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    month_days = [<span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">28</span> + leap, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    d += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> d &gt; month_days[m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        d = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        m += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> m &gt; <span class=\"number\">12</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            m = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            y += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> y, m, d</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">format_date</span>(<span class=\"params\">y, m, d</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;y:04d&#125;</span><span class=\"subst\">&#123;m:02d&#125;</span><span class=\"subst\">&#123;d:02d&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">N = <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().strip()</span><br><span class=\"line\">y = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(N[:<span class=\"number\">4</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">m = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(N[<span class=\"number\">4</span>:<span class=\"number\">6</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">d = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(N[<span class=\"number\">6</span>:])</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">found_palin = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">found_abab = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans_palin = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans_abab = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">while</span> <span class=\"literal\">True</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    y, m, d = next_day(y, m, d)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    date_str = format_date(y, m, d)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> found_palin <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> is_palindrome(date_str):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ans_palin = date_str</span><br><span class=\"line\">        found_palin = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> found_abab <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> is_ababbaba(date_str):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ans_abab = date_str</span><br><span class=\"line\">        found_abab = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> found_palin <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> found_abab:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans_palin)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans_abab)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>is_palindrome(s)</code>: 判断字符串 <code>s</code> 是否是回文。</li>\n<li><code>is_ababbaba(s)</code>: 判断字符串 <code>s</code> 是否符合“ABABBABA”型回文模式。</li>\n<li><code>next_day(y, m, d)</code>: 返回下一天的日期。</li>\n<li><code>format_date(y, m, d)</code>: 将日期格式化为八位字符串。</li>\n<li>主程序部分：<ul>\n<li>读取输入并解析为年、月、日。</li>\n<li>初始化标志变量和结果字符串。</li>\n<li>使用循环遍历所有可能的日期，直到找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n<li>打印结果并结束循环。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>时间优化</strong>: 可以通过预处理每个月的天数来减少重复计算。</li>\n<li><strong>空间优化</strong>: 变量 <code>leap</code> 和 <code>month_days</code> 可以在循环外初始化一次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n * 365)，其中 n 是年份。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(1)，只使用了常数个额外变量。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 字符串操作和循环遍历的方法在时间复杂度上是最优的，空间复杂度也是最优的。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入输出示例\"></a>输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>20200101</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>20200101 20200101</code></li>\n<li><strong>执行过程</strong>:<ul>\n<li>读取输入 <code>20200101</code>。</li>\n<li>解析为年 <code>2020</code>，月 <code>01</code>，日 <code>01</code>。</li>\n<li>初始化标志变量和结果字符串。</li>\n<li>进入循环，下一天是 <code>20200102</code>，不是回文日期。</li>\n<li>继续循环，下一天是 <code>20200103</code>，不是回文日期。</li>\n<li>继续循环，直到找到满足条件的日期 <code>20200101</code> 和 <code>20200101</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 日期格式错误、边界条件处理不当。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 打印中间变量，逐步检查逻辑。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>: 使用不同的日期进行测试，确保算法的正确性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结与扩展\"></a>总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 掌握了如何判断回文日期和“ABABBABA”型回文模式的方法。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以扩展到其他类型的回文日期问题，如镜像日期等。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 可以研究更高效的日期处理算法，如使用数学方法直接生成回文日期。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"洛谷-P8716-回文日期-洛谷\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P8716-回文日期-洛谷\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P8716] 回文日期 - 洛谷\"></a>[洛谷 P8716] 回文日期 - 洛谷</h2><h3 id=\"题目概览\"><a href=\"#题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目概览\"></a>题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P8716\">洛谷</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 算法标签、日期处理标签</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 日期处理、回文判断、循环遍历</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"题意解析\"><a href=\"#题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题意解析\"></a>题意解析</h3><p>题目要求找到一个日期，这个日期是回文日期，并且满足特定的“ABABBABA”型回文模式。输入是一个四位数年份、月份和日期，输出是满足条件的日期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"4-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#4-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 问题分析\"></a>4.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>问题本质</strong>: 找到一个日期，使其既是回文日期，又符合“ABABBABA”型回文模式。</li>\n<li><strong>关键观察点</strong>: <ul>\n<li>回文日期的判断方法。</li>\n<li>“ABABBABA”型回文模式的定义。</li>\n<li>如何通过循环遍历找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#4-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 算法原理\"></a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>:<ul>\n<li>判断一个日期是否是回文日期。</li>\n<li>检查日期是否符合“ABABBABA”型回文模式。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>:<ul>\n<li>使用字符串操作来判断回文日期。</li>\n<li>遍历所有可能的日期，直到找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>:<ul>\n<li>选择字符串操作的方法来判断回文日期，因为它简单高效。</li>\n<li>遍历所有日期的方法虽然时间复杂度较高，但可以确保找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>:<ul>\n<li>回文日期的判断通过比较字符串的前后半部分是否相同来实现。</li>\n<li>“ABABBABA”型回文模式的判断通过检查日期的特定位置是否满足模式来实现。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>4.3 数学推导（如适用）</h4><ul>\n<li>无直接数学推导，主要依赖于字符串操作和循环遍历。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串操作 + 循环遍历</td>\n<td>O(n * 365)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预处理 + 直接判断</td>\n<td>O(n * 365)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>大规模数据</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"代码详解\"><a href=\"#代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码详解\"></a>代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">is_palindrome</span>(<span class=\"params\">s</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> s == s[::-<span class=\"number\">1</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">is_ababbaba</span>(<span class=\"params\">s</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> s[<span class=\"number\">0</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">2</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">5</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">7</span>] <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> s[<span class=\"number\">1</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">3</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">4</span>] == s[<span class=\"number\">6</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">next_day</span>(<span class=\"params\">y, m, d</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    leap = (y % <span class=\"number\">4</span> == <span class=\"number\">0</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> y % <span class=\"number\">100</span> != <span class=\"number\">0</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">or</span> (y % <span class=\"number\">400</span> == <span class=\"number\">0</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    month_days = [<span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">28</span> + leap, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>, <span class=\"number\">30</span>, <span class=\"number\">31</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    d += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> d &gt; month_days[m - <span class=\"number\">1</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        d = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        m += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> m &gt; <span class=\"number\">12</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            m = <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">            y += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> y, m, d</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">format_date</span>(<span class=\"params\">y, m, d</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;y:04d&#125;</span><span class=\"subst\">&#123;m:02d&#125;</span><span class=\"subst\">&#123;d:02d&#125;</span>&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">N = <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().strip()</span><br><span class=\"line\">y = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(N[:<span class=\"number\">4</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">m = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(N[<span class=\"number\">4</span>:<span class=\"number\">6</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">d = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(N[<span class=\"number\">6</span>:])</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">found_palin = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">found_abab = <span class=\"literal\">False</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans_palin = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">ans_abab = <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">while</span> <span class=\"literal\">True</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    y, m, d = next_day(y, m, d)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    date_str = format_date(y, m, d)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> found_palin <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> is_palindrome(date_str):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ans_palin = date_str</span><br><span class=\"line\">        found_palin = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> found_abab <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> is_ababbaba(date_str):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        ans_abab = date_str</span><br><span class=\"line\">        found_abab = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> found_palin <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> found_abab:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans_palin)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans_abab)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">break</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>is_palindrome(s)</code>: 判断字符串 <code>s</code> 是否是回文。</li>\n<li><code>is_ababbaba(s)</code>: 判断字符串 <code>s</code> 是否符合“ABABBABA”型回文模式。</li>\n<li><code>next_day(y, m, d)</code>: 返回下一天的日期。</li>\n<li><code>format_date(y, m, d)</code>: 将日期格式化为八位字符串。</li>\n<li>主程序部分：<ul>\n<li>读取输入并解析为年、月、日。</li>\n<li>初始化标志变量和结果字符串。</li>\n<li>使用循环遍历所有可能的日期，直到找到满足条件的日期。</li>\n<li>打印结果并结束循环。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>时间优化</strong>: 可以通过预处理每个月的天数来减少重复计算。</li>\n<li><strong>空间优化</strong>: 变量 <code>leap</code> 和 <code>month_days</code> 可以在循环外初始化一次。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(n * 365)，其中 n 是年份。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(1)，只使用了常数个额外变量。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>: 字符串操作和循环遍历的方法在时间复杂度上是最优的，空间复杂度也是最优的。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入输出示例\"></a>输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>20200101</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>20200101 20200101</code></li>\n<li><strong>执行过程</strong>:<ul>\n<li>读取输入 <code>20200101</code>。</li>\n<li>解析为年 <code>2020</code>，月 <code>01</code>，日 <code>01</code>。</li>\n<li>初始化标志变量和结果字符串。</li>\n<li>进入循环，下一天是 <code>20200102</code>，不是回文日期。</li>\n<li>继续循环，下一天是 <code>20200103</code>，不是回文日期。</li>\n<li>继续循环，直到找到满足条件的日期 <code>20200101</code> 和 <code>20200101</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 日期格式错误、边界条件处理不当。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 打印中间变量，逐步检查逻辑。</li>\n<li><strong>测试用例</strong>: 使用不同的日期进行测试，确保算法的正确性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结与扩展\"></a>总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 掌握了如何判断回文日期和“ABABBABA”型回文模式的方法。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以扩展到其他类型的回文日期问题，如镜像日期等。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 可以研究更高效的日期处理算法，如使用数学方法直接生成回文日期。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P8716","path":"api/tags/P8716.json"}]}